us puede/o algo de ªnime puedes hallar/hoven padawan/las que te ponías en VHS o tu madre te decía en mis tiempos habia cosas muy bonitas/no como los Pokémon esos que el muñeco solo mueve la boca/Comando G","image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/0/0e/Science_Ninja_Team_Gatchaman.jpg","info":"","stations":[{"name":"Comando G -Cap 1--El rescate de los astronautas","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/aa96d1dac52cb537623589a5cba6edf1?fid=4398713428586-250528-21346859404021&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-duoawV61l5ecqCGHilVgbEVezY0%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=362335581541697860&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785726475&r=814457854&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"Comando G -Cap 2--La momia espacial","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/91a1e7149b7071782e97ec1d20bf5fbd?fid=4398713428586-250528-667754988449471&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-Nf%2fh7jxTM%2bQZJh1CJjM0mmnLS6M%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=362335581541697860&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785726475&r=186939112&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"Comando G -Cap 3--La serpiente espacial","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/6775ed3136546adfd273a86ae882cf65?fid=4398713428586-250528-904414759120738&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-zSXDUgt3nInW%2bqkL9N6E%2b%2fVMnlQ%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=362335581541697860&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785726475&r=286214903&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"Comando G -Cap 4--Barco fantasma del planeta Mir","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/e556e2c909857eb1578ffba3404b96ca?fid=4398713428586-250528-136861018117509&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb740ccc5511e5e8fedcff06b081203-5EfmMTnilFXN1Yl1C2EcKrM5Y3I%3d&expires=8h&chkbd=0&chkv=0&dp-logid=362335581541697860&dp-callid=0&dstime=1785726475&r=258358349&vuk=4398713428586&origin=dlna"},{"name":"Comando G -Cap 5--Gran asalto robot al oro","url":"https://d.terabox.com/file/504fca46b7cf5ba335864e98faf82f7f?fid=4398713428586-250528-988264009725491&rt=pr&sign=FDtAERK-DCb7